title: "Memory Architecture Quality Standard (MAQS)"
abstract: "A practical 99-item audit standard for evaluating persistent-memory architectures in LLM-based assistants and agents. Covers the system map, ingestion, write integrity, growth and retention, retrieval, context assembly, feedback loops, isolation, concurrency, observability, and change management."
